            "review_title": "Review at Banh Canh Cua 102",
            "review_text": "Marmitefan58\n63 contributions\n2\nGreat food, great price\nApr 2019 • Solo\nStumbled upon this place in Hoi An old town, away from the hustle and bustle of the crowds.it looked clean and local people appeared to be enjoying it. The broth with crab cake, rice noodles and shrimp was delicious. The menu isn’t extensive but what they do is produce tasty food well and at a good price. I will be going back\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 5, 2019\ndiễm v\nThanks! See you again!\nWritten April 15, 2019\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
